  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 - Internal Endpoints & Enhanced Testing\n- NEW: GetStatsAsync - Dashboard statistics\n- NEW: GetRecentEventsAsync - Recent access events\n- NEW: GetSubjectEventsAsync - Subject access history\n- NEW: GetEventAsync - Single event lookup\n- NEW: GetSourceStatusAsync - Source system status\n- NEW: GetTopAccessorsAsync - Top data accessors\n- NEW: SetBearerToken/ClearBearerToken - User JWT auth for internal endpoints\n- NEW: Convenience methods LogViewAsync, LogExportAsync, LogBulkViewAsync, LogBulkExportAsync\n- Added InternalApiModels: GlbaStats, AccessEvent, SourceSystemStatus, AccessorSummary\n\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release\n- Single event logging with LogAccessAsync\n- Batch logging with LogAccessBatchAsync (up to 1000 events)\n- Fire-and-forget logging with TryLogAccessAsync\n- Bulk subject tracking for exports (SubjectIds)\n- Dependency injection support via AddGlbaClient extension\n- Automatic retry with exponential backoff\n- Full async/await support",
